      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This guy isn''t quite sane. He spends most of his time asleep, but don''t
    drop your guard...


    - Threat: When he wakes up, he''ll ramble about conspiracies.
    He will flood your screen with noise and text bubbles, distracting you from other
    hazards.


    - Mechanic: Scan through the text bubbles on screen and find the
    one related to aliens.


    - Solution: Select the correct message to satisfy
    him so he shuts up and goes back to sleep.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
