  m_text: 'Dangers aren''t just inside the bus. Pay attention to the window on your
    right...


    - Threat: If you hear a motorcycle engine, a thief will try to
    reach in and steal your money.


    - Counter: Close the window immediately
    upon hearing the engine to block the thief.


    - Warning (Heat): Don''t keep
    it closed forever. The suffocating heat inside the bus will make you dizzy and
    lightheaded if left closed for too long.'
