      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A suspicious stranger is creeping up behind you to rob you.


    Mechanic:
    He will slowly advance only when you are NOT looking at him (listen for his footsteps).


    Threat:
    He will move step-by-step until he reaches his final position right behind you.


    Counter:
    As soon as he hits the final spot behind you, turn around and look at him immediately
    to stop him.

'
