  m_text: 'Night traffic is unpredictable, and the bus will slam on its brakes suddenly.


    Warning
    Signal: You will hear a car horn and see a danger alert on screen right before
    the bus brakes.


    Counter: Quickly locate a visible handrail and click on
    it to grab hold.


    Warning: If you fail to grab a handrail in time, you''ll
    lose your balance and be temporarily stunned.'
